  "metadata": {
    "title": "FM Electric Piano",
    "description": "Two-operator FM in the style of a tine piano: a 1:1 modulator sets the brightness, a short 14:1 burst adds the bark, notes decay while held, and a stereo tremolo pans the result. The keys voice plays notes 21-100, keeping the modulated frequency below Nyquist."
